--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party data
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project bundles reference data derived from the following upstream
projects, each under its own license (all MIT unless noted). Their licenses are
separate from this project's Apache-2.0 license and continue to apply to that
data.

packages/data-id-address/data/

  admin-hierarchy.json, village-postal-index.json
    Indonesian region codes and names (province / regency / district /
    desa / kelurahan), from Kepmendagri references via:
      - github.com/cahyadsn/wilayah            (MIT)
    and postal codes from:
      - github.com/cahyadsn/wilayah_kodepos    (MIT)

  postal-index.json
    Postal code to district mapping, from Kepmendagri references via:
      - github.com/cahyadsn/wilayah_kodepos    (MIT)

  plate-region-codes.json
    Vehicle plate region codes. Community-sourced; NOT from an official
    Korlantas dataset. Treated as a hint, not verified fact.

packages/id/data/

  regions.json
    Indonesian province and regency codes, from Kepmendagri references via:
      - github.com/lokabisa-oss/region-id       (MIT)

packages/global/currency/data/

  iso4217.json
    ISO 4217 currency, fund and precious-metal code list, published by
    SIX Financial Information as the ISO 4217 Maintenance Agency:
      - https://www.six-group.com/en/products-services/financial-information/
        market-reference-data/data-standards.html
    ISO permits free use of the country, currency and language code standards.
    SIX retains rights in its compilation; see the source page for its terms.

packages/global/iban/data/

  iban-countries.json
    IBAN country codes and total lengths, compiled from the SWIFT IBAN
    Registry (ISO 13616) via:
      - https://www.iban.com/structure
    See that page for its reuse and attribution terms.

packages/global/phone/data/

  calling-codes.json
    Country calling codes, from ITU-T E.164 assignments:
      - https://www.itu.int/oth/T0202.aspx
